whipper.description:
{Whipper}

{gold|Special Ability : Generate resource}

Each Whipper in hero army produces 2 pieces of gold every day. Whippers stationed in any town's garrison produce 4 pieces instead.

overseer.description:
{Overseer}

{gold|Special Ability : Generate resource}

Each Overseer in hero army produces 3 pieces of gold every day. Overseers stationed in any town's garrison produce 6 pieces instead.

wadjet.description:
{Wadjet}

{gold|Special Ability : Flying}

Flying is a special ability of creatures, which allows them to bypass obstacles (e.g. walls) during combat. Having creatures with this special ability in a hero's army does not affect the movement of that hero on the adventure map in any way (meaning that flying creatures also cause a movement penalty on non-native terrain).

venomousWadjet.description:
{Venomous Wadjet}

{gold|Special Ability : Can inflict Poison after attack. Flying.}

Venomous Wadjets have 20% chance to inflict Poison after attack.
Poison causes a creature to lose 10% of its health each turn. This state lasts 3 turns.
